      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "§ePedestals§r in the structures of Ike hold §6Divine Shards§r. Four of them, four meteorite ingots and a balefire shard make the item that summons the §6Radioactive Angel§r.\n\nThe Angel is a flying boss with 10,000 health. It sweeps the ground with a beam that deals 1,000 damage and heavy radiation to anything below it, and sprays balefire. After each hit it is briefly invulnerable, so many weak hits are wasted - bring your heaviest single-shot weapons. It disappears on Peaceful.\n\nIt drops the §6Angelic Core§r, a battery that holds 16 MHE and delivers up to 800 kHE per tick.\n\n§cAs it dies, the stars begin to flicker: its death brings an invasion to the planet it died on.§r",
